WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.750
Winter came to Eco Town. And so did the rain.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:08.661
<v Dev>Dev: Look through the flood lens! The meadow floods every winter.

3
00:00:08.731 --> 00:00:11.146
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. You said best. I guessed flat.

4
00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:14.428
<v Posy>Posy: Try this. Dry, sunny land. Keep the meadow wild.

5
00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:18.289
<v Florence>Florence: Dry land on the slope. The meadow stays wild. Checked!

6
00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:23.482
Flat land by a river can flood. So build on dry ground, and keep the meadow wild.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:28.002
And an AI can take one word too far. So say what you really mean.
